  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arb 207.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide uniform procedures for the conduct of public comment hearings held pursuant to RSA 541-A:11.\n\nSource. #9116-A, eff 3-27-08",
